---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <header class="channel-header animate-on-scroll">
    <p class="eyebrow">PUBLISHING DESK · 从想法到公共表达</p>
    <h1>发布</h1>
    <p>把散落的思考收进博客，经过整理、校对与适配，再发布到合适的媒体。本站是所有内容的原始版本与长期档案。</p>
  </header>

  <section class="publish-flow animate-on-scroll" aria-label="发布流程">
    <div><span>01</span><strong>存储思想</strong><p>笔记、素材与草稿</p></div>
    <div><span>02</span><strong>编辑成稿</strong><p>研究、校对与配图</p></div>
    <div><span>03</span><strong>本站首发</strong><p>保留唯一原始版本</p></div>
    <div><span>04</span><strong>媒体分发</strong><p>按平台重新适配</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="channel-status animate-on-scroll">
    <div class="status-heading"><span>发布渠道</span><span>连接状态</span></div>
    <div class="status-row"><strong>Charlie Liu Blog</strong><span class="status live">已连接</span></div>
    <div class="status-row"><strong>今日头条</strong><span class="status pending">待接入账号 / API</span></div>
    <div class="status-row"><strong>其他媒体</strong><span class="status pending">规划中</span></div>
  </section>

  <p class="publish-note">原则：先形成自己的原始表达，再为平台调整标题、摘要、封面和篇幅。</p>
</BaseLayout>
